      <title>台灣核電重啟拍板 反核曾為政黨"神主牌" 賴清德: 撐起 AI 算力需求 - unwire.hk 香港</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2026/03/23/taiwan-nuclear-restart-green-energy-policy/fun-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=taiwan-nuclear-restart-green-energy-policy</link>
      <description>台灣總統賴清德昨日出席童軍節慶祝大會，強調台灣面對經濟增長、AI 算力需求及歐盟碳邊境調整機制（CBAM）等新挑戰，能源須量足、低碳且具韌性。台電已向經濟部提出核二、核三廠重啟申請，經濟部評估具重啟條件，預計 3 月底送核安會審議，政府同時持續推動綠能，兩者並行。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2026/03/23/taiwan-nuclear-restart-green-energy-policy/fun-tech/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=taiwan-nuclear-restart-green-energy-policy</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/np3_in_taiwan-scaled.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 07:58:01 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
